 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2022-07-20",
   "text": "Healthy Meals, Healthy Kids Act\n This bill reauthorizes and expands (1) child nutrition programs, including the National School Lunch Program (NSLP) and other institutional food service programs; and (2) the Special Supplemental Nutrition Program for Women, Infants, and Children (WIC)."
  },
  {
